ex-base\"><span class=\"strut katex-strut\" style=\"height:1.0019em;vertical-align:-.25em\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:.10764em\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:.7519em\"><span class=\"\" style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:.05em\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight katex-sizing\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>\n。</p><div class=\"answer-container td-max-width-on-larger-screens\"></div>", "source": "https://www.csgraduates.com/study_methods/math/math2/2025/#18", "section": "解答题", "points": 12, "latex": "（本题满分12分）\n设函数\n$f(x)$\n在\n$x = 0$\n处连续，且\n$\\lim _{x\\to 0} \\frac{xf(x)-e^{2 \\sin x}+1}{\\ln (1+x)+\\ln (1-x)} = -3$\n。\n证明\n$f(x)$\n在\n$x = 0$\n处可导，并求\n$f^{'}(0)$\n。", "latexFormulas": ["f(x)", "x = 0", "\\lim _{x\\to 0} \\frac{xf(x)-e^{2 \\sin x}+1}{\\ln (1+x)+\\ln (1-x)} = -3", "f(x)", "x = 0", "f^{'}(0)"]}